{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a free-form railway simulation game meticulously developed over a year by a true railway enthusiast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celebrate the 11th Anniversary of Kurakyu Railway!</strong><br>Finally arriving on STEAM, brought to you by YouTuber &quot;Shinise&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879810/extras/d7718762bd037120457c58db4ff1b444.avif?t=1761710338\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879810/extras_big/d7718762bd037120457c58db4ff1b444.avif?t=1761710338 width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010What can you do? So much to do! Packed with features!\u3011</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive trains manually</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch automatic driving in viewing mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own timetables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive according to your own schedule</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger announcements at your favorite stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive precisely to the stopping position and speed limits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignore stopping positions and speed limits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive side-by-side with airplanes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run alongside lines emerging from subways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use free camera to observe trains from any angle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and much more fun packed in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010What is Kurakyu Railway?\u3011</strong><br>Kurakyu Railway is a semi-major private railway operating lines in Shichito and Torigaoka prefectures. The official name is Kurata Express Railway, abbreviated as &quot;Kurakyu&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879810/extras/7848e74674708f8e6fcb90b23e478eb2.avif?t=1761710338\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879810/extras_big/7848e74674708f8e6fcb90b23e478eb2.avif?t=1761710338 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The railway originated with the goal of connecting Itokurata in Kohkai Prefecture. It operates various lines such as the Shimahoku Line, Ukura Line, and Shichito Line. The Shimahoku Line is especially noted as part of the \u201cSakishima Local Lines\u201d along with the Minato and Kikokawa lines.<br>This game features 10 fictional stations inspired by the Sakishima and Minato lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879810/extras/aa6e735916a7fabcfe378430803986fd.avif?t=1761710338\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879810/extras_big/aa6e735916a7fabcfe378430803986fd.avif?t=1761710338 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879810/extras/688d821c00db73634be209d34e41f07f.avif?t=1761710338\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879810/extras_big/688d821c00db73634be209d34e41f07f.avif?t=1761710338 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879810?t=1761710338","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879810?t=1761710338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879810/fa76b596749c796636975ddde5187d015201ba91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761710338","cap